{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overdawn</strong> is a fast-paced, bullet-time, bullet-hell shooter set in a world on the brink of collapse. Play as one of the Chosen Ones\u2014sent into the past to stop the fall of Andrean. Fight through waves of enemies with razor-sharp gunplay, uncover buried truths, and explore a stunning 2.5D world brought to life with style and atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 2.5D pixel-voxel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, precision gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story campaign where your choices shape the path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually striking world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BULLET TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c0f8617397fd03b88fd82aadd3654e0e.poster.avif?t=1761958793\" width=1170 height=373 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c0f8617397fd03b88fd82aadd3654e0e.webm?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through storms of enemy fire while slowing time to land the perfect headshot. Precision isn\u2019t a luxury\u2014it\u2019s survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CRITICAL EDGE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/23d8609b91d9d01bf5f010237703af20.poster.avif?t=1761958793\" width=1170 height=373 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/23d8609b91d9d01bf5f010237703af20.webm?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success is measured in milliseconds and millimeters. From the trajectory of your dash to the headshot you line up in slow motion, every action is governed by pinpoint precision. Mastery over your movement and aim is the only path to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STYLISH DYSTOPIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.poster.avif?t=1761958793\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.webm?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.mp4?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique 2.5D world filled with dramatic set pieces and stylish visuals. From a war-torn city to an ethereal garden, every environment pulls you deeper into the fall of Andrean\u2014stylized, immersive, and made to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONVERSATIONS MATTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.poster.avif?t=1761958793\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.webm?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.mp4?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into dynamic conversations where every word matters. Dialogue shapes your path as you uncover the truth behind Andrean\u2019s downfall. Text comes to life with emotion as you connect with allies, confront enemies, and push forward to the very end.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL TREE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/70eb2e48e1c9e3d82880c736a31aab61.poster.avif?t=1761958793\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/70eb2e48e1c9e3d82880c736a31aab61.webm?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/70eb2e48e1c9e3d82880c736a31aab61.mp4?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire and develop a broad set of skills to become the precise tool needed to rewrite history. Each upgrade brings you closer to changing the apocalyptic future and mastering the art of the perfect kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small indie team with a big love for games\u2014and <strong>Overdawn</strong> is the game we\u2019ve always wanted to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Youngje</strong> began development in Unity over two years ago, and since then, he and the current team have expanded and refined it. From late-night bug fixes to hand-crafting every scene, we\u2019ve poured our hearts into this project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s been a wild ride, and we\u2019re so excited to finally share it with you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/2591cf18c65481850f7bcf27bbcb2791.avif?t=1761958793\" width=899 height=568 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519070?t=1761958793","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519070?t=1761958793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/cd523647dff2fec8e18e6694dd825060d22ea1c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761958793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/cd523647dff2fec8e18e6694dd825060d22ea1c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761958793","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3988240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overdawn</strong> is a fast-paced, bullet-time, bullet-hell shooter set in a world on the brink of collapse. Play as one of the Chosen Ones\u2014sent into the past to stop the fall of Andrean. Fight through waves of enemies with razor-sharp gunplay, uncover buried truths, and explore a stunning 2.5D world brought to life with style and atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 2.5D pixel-voxel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, precision gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story campaign where your choices shape the path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually striking world</p><p class=\"