am/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.webm?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/c003fc0221d5725d0c3d6ae0c188e03f.mp4?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique 2.5D world filled with dramatic set pieces and stylish visuals. From a war-torn city to an ethereal garden, every environment pulls you deeper into the fall of Andrean\u2014stylized, immersive, and made to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONVERSATIONS MATTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.poster.avif?t=1761958793\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.webm?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/97f29c1e4d0e69016bd62c0076758f0c.mp4?t=1761958793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into dynamic conversations where every word matters. Dialogue shapes your path as you uncover the truth behind Andrean\u2019s downfall. Text comes to life with emotion as you connect with allies, confront enemies, and push forward to the very end.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL TREE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519070/extras/70eb2e48e1c9e3d82880c736a31aab61.poster.avif?t=1761958793\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea